id: precedence-mask-etc-over-usrlib
category: precedence
images: rs-oracle9
targets: rhel9
key: kernel.randomize_va_space
xfail_issue: 
comment: same-basename directory masking: etc/sysctl.d/50-x.conf (rank 0) masks usr/lib/sysctl.d/50-x.conf (rank 3) entirely by NAME - the masked file's fs.suid_dumpable assignment never applies. Confirmed empirically: real systemd logs 'Skipping overridden file'.
